    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/legacy-medical-appointment/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Legacy Medical Appointment is a powerful, professional, and user-friendly theme designed for healthcare providers, medical clinics, hospitals, doctors, dentists, pediatricians, surgeons, specialists, physiotherapists, therapists, chiropractors, mental health professionals, wellness centers, healthcare consultants, diagnostic labs, medical offices, telemedicine providers, and online health service platforms. It offers a complete system for managing medical appointments, online booking, patient scheduling, teleconsultations, prescription follow-ups, emergency visits, and automated appointment reminders to streamline healthcare operations. With a clean, responsive, and modern interface, the theme ensures smooth functionality and accessibility across desktops, tablets, and smartphones, giving patients an easy way to connect with healthcare professionals. Integrated with the Bookly plugin for smart appointment booking and calendar management, it also supports compatibility with Contact Form 7 and Yoast SEO for enhanced communication and search optimization. Key features include sections for doctor profiles, treatment categories, department listings, patient testimonials, health blogs, service showcases, and medical FAQs. Its SEO-friendly code, mobile optimization, and fast-loading performance make it ideal for hospitals, private clinics, dental practices, therapy centers, rehabilitation facilities, and telehealth portals. With customizable layouts, banners, and color schemes, Legacy Medical Appointment helps build a trustworthy, professional, and accessible digital healthcare platform that promotes efficiency, engagement, and improved patient experience."
    },
